<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Capital Asia shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Capital Asia shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of property investment and financial services group Capital Asia Ltd was suspended on Wednesday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>On Tuesday, Capital Asia shares rose HK$0.13 or 22 percent to HK$1.72 on volume of 59.68 million shares worth HK$101.43 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
